          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We examine the legal framework for offshore wind leasing under the Submerged Lands Act and the Outer Continental Shelf Lands Act. The article covers lease auctions, environmental reviews (NEPA), and conflicts with fishing and shipping interests. Recent BOEM lease sales are analyzed.</p>"
