          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We analyze the legal and practical difficulties of reporting Scope 3 emissions (value chain). Using data from 100 large filers, we show that most companies lack reliable data. The article proposes safe harbors and reasonable estimation methodologies.</p>"
