          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We analyze SEC enforcement actions against companies for inadequate climate disclosures (e.g., Vale S.A. settlement). The article identifies patterns: fines ranging from $5-25 million, requirements for independent consultants, and ongoing monitoring. Compliance tips are provided.</p>"
