        "Aims & Scope": "<p>The Journal of Pharmaceutical Policy and Global Health (JPPGH) is a peer-reviewed, regularly published academic journal under Academic Research Centre Journals Publishers, dedicated to advancing interdisciplinary scholarship on pharmaceutical policy, healthcare systems, and global health challenges. The journal provides a platform for rigorous research examining policies, regulations, and practices related to pharmaceuticals, healthcare delivery, access to medicines, and the broader implications for global public health.</p>\n<p>JPPGH aims to foster critical understanding of the intersection between pharmaceutical governance, health policy, and societal health outcomes. The journal encourages contributions that integrate perspectives from public health, pharmacology, policy studies, economics, law, and development studies.</p>\n<h4>Scope</h4>\n<p><strong>JPPGH welcomes original research articles, policy analyses, case studies, conceptual papers, and applied scholarship across a broad range of topics, including but not limited to:</strong></p>\n<p><strong>Pharmaceutical Policy:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Regulation, governance, and ethical frameworks in pharmaceuticals</li><li>Drug approval, safety, pricing, and accessibility</li><li>Intellectual property rights, patents, and generic medicines</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Global Health:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Health systems, policy interventions, and universal health coverage</li><li>Access to medicines, equity, and social determinants of health</li><li>Global health governance and international collaborations</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Healthcare Innovation and Delivery:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Innovations in drug development, digital health, and telemedicine</li><li>Strategies for improving healthcare delivery and outcomes</li><li>Community-based healthcare and patient-centered approaches</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Interdisciplinary Approaches:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Integration of public health, pharmacology, law, economics, policy studies, and development studies</li><li>Empirical, comparative, and theoretical research methodologies</li><li>Cross-national and regional perspectives on pharmaceutical policy and global health</li></ul>\n<p><strong>Applied and Emerging Research:</strong></p>\n<ul><li>Case studies on pharmaceutical policy implementation, healthcare reform, and access initiatives</li><li>Emerging trends in pharmaceuticals, vaccines, and health technologies</li><li>Evaluation of policy impacts on health equity, population health, and societal outcomes</li></ul>\n<p>JPPGH serves as a platform for scholars, policymakers, healthcare professionals, and interdisciplinary researchers to explore the complex interactions between pharmaceutical policy and global health. The journal emphasizes research that bridges theory and practice, promotes international collaboration, and contributes to the development of sustainable, equitable, and effective healthcare and pharmaceutical systems worldwide.</p>",
