          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We analyze federal ransomware disclosure requirements under the Cyber Incident Reporting for Critical Infrastructure Act (CIRCIA). The article covers reporting timelines, content requirements, and liability protections for timely reports.</p>"
