          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>This article demonstrates how zero-trust architecture (ZTA) can help organizations comply with GDPR Article 25 (data protection by design). We map ZTA principles (continuous verification, least privilege) to specific GDPR requirements and provide implementation guidance.</p>"
