          "title": "Breach Liability Reduction via Zero-Trust Models",
          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We argue that organizations implementing zero-trust architecture may reduce their liability in data breach lawsuits by demonstrating reasonable security measures. The article reviews case law where security posture affected damages.</p>"
