          "title": "HIPAA Safeguards and Zero-Trust Implementation in Healthcare",
          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We analyze how zero-trust architecture meets HIPAA's administrative, physical, and technical safeguards. The article includes a risk assessment template for healthcare organizations adopting ZTA.</p>"
