        {
          "title": "Digital Markets Act: Platform Obligations and Enforcement",
          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>This article analyzes the DMA's impact on legal tech platforms designated as gatekeepers (e.g., Thomson Reuters, LexisNexis). Obligations include data portability, interoperability, and bans on self-preferencing. We assess enforcement risks.</p>"
        }
