          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We analyze emerging global standards from ISO/IEC, IEEE, and the GPAI. The article argues for mandatory third-party audits for high-risk AI systems, modeled on financial audits. A draft global AI safety standard is proposed.</p>"
