          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>We review derivative lawsuits against directors for failing to manage climate risks (e.g., ClientEarth v. Shell). The article argues that under Caremark, directors have a duty to monitor climate risks as a compliance issue. Sample board minutes and risk reports are included.</p>"
