          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>This article provides a detailed analysis of the SEC's final climate disclosure rules (Release No. 33-11275). We examine the materiality standard for Scope 1, 2, and 3 emissions, the phase-in periods, and potential liability for omissions. The article also discusses pending legal challenges in the Fifth Circuit.</p>"
