          "image": "images/arts.png",
          "fullContent": "<p>This article explores whether institutional investors breach fiduciary duties by failing to engage portfolio companies on climate risks. We review ERISA guidance and recent shareholder proposals. The article concludes that engagement is consistent with prudent investing.</p>"
